---
import OptimizedImage from "../../../components/OptimizedImage.astro";
---
<div class="w-full"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/19208a312a4f.webp" alt="Cover" width="2560" height="450" class="block w-full h-auto" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" /></div>

    <article class="px-6 mb:px-16 dt:px-35 pt-10">
      <header>
        <h1 class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10">kaeru sticker</h1>
      </header>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word">A frog sticker set - the same set drawn once with Japanese captions and once with Vietnamese.<br>(Placeholder text, to be updated.)</p>

      <section class="mt-14 mb:mt-16" aria-label="Artwork">
        <h2 class="sr-only">Artwork</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 dt:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mb:gap-12.5 items-start">
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-250"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/7fb0f2c5281a.webp" alt="Artwork 1" width="2000" height="1767" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="dt:col-span-2 mx-auto w-full max-w-250"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/db327b4a4f72.webp" alt="Artwork 2" width="2000" height="1811" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/b1905fee73c5.webp" alt="Artwork 3" width="1400" height="2104" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/734c34470211.webp" alt="Artwork 4" width="1400" height="2108" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        </div>
        </section>

      <div class="mt-18 mb:mt-22 flex flex-col items-center gap-10 mb:gap-11">

        <p class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10 text-center">Thanks for watching!</p>
      </div>

      <a href="/en/illustration" id="back-link" class="img-btn block w-34 h-6.5 mt-17 mb-21 bg-left!" style="background-image:url(/assets/icons/back.png)" aria-label="Back" title="Back"></a>
    </article>
